abstract: >-
  ANAXI: A DIGITAL KARDIA is a completed persistent-agent architecture and
  public reference case focused on truthful provenance, bounded authority,
  privacy, continuity, recovery, reversibility, and meaningful end-to-end
  affordance. The repository also includes an ANAXI-specific reproducibility
  distribution and a standalone portable claim harness.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - persistent agents
  - provenance
  - authority
  - privacy
  - recovery
  - reproducibility
  - agent evaluation
